        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sheet rolling, electric steel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sheet rolling, electric steel
This process was created based on the following process: "Sheet rolling, steel {RER}". The material input for the loss consists of 100% secondary material.  
UUID: e94b921f-9da1-40da-8bd3-7a2c3432f9bf
Location: Data relate to plants in Europe
Technology: Average technique for EU, for un- and low-alloyed electric steel. A 50-50 mix is inventoried where different technologies are apllied for the same process step (e.g. pickling)
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Data from literature
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e94b921f-9da1-40da-8bd3-7a2c3432f9bf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
